---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'March 1, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms and conditions governing your use of AppScoutHub, including disclaimers, affiliate disclosures, and limitations of liability."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <p>
        By accessing or using appscouthub.com (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you
        do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Use of the site</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to use this Site only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of, or
        restrict, or inhibit anyone else's use of the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Content and accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        Reviews, ratings, and comparisons published on this Site reflect our own testing and opinions at the time of
        writing. AI tools and their pricing change frequently — always verify current details directly with the
        provider before making a purchasing decision. We make no warranties as to the completeness or accuracy of
        any content on the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this Site are affiliate links. We may earn a commission when you sign up or make a purchase
        through these links, at no extra cost to you. Affiliate relationships never influence our ratings or
        editorial opinions.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        All original content on this Site, including text, graphics, and logos, is the property of AppScoutHub
        unless otherwise noted, and may not be reproduced without permission. Third-party product names, logos, and
        trademarks belong to their respective owners.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        AppScoutHub is not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your
        use of the Site or reliance on any information published here, including decisions made about third-party
        AI tools and software.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This Site links to third-party websites and services we do not control. We are not responsible for the
        content, terms, or privacy practices of those external sites.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted
        constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Reach out via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:hello@appscouthub.com">hello@appscouthub.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
